{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026YLANNJqMSz1795842980.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>台灣今日舉行九合一選舉。</p><p></p><p>其中焦點之一是台北市長選舉。競逐連任、國民黨的蔣萬安，以及民進黨的沈伯洋，上午分別到票站投票。</p><p></p><p>四年一度的九合一選舉，投票由上午八時開始，下午四時結束，將會選出縣市長、縣市議員等九項地方公職人員約1.1萬人，以及一項「廢除非核家園」公投。選民人數有約1,957萬。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T06:03:46.217706+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T04:19:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T14:13:01.591554+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T05:57:13.894312+00:00","content_hash":"0c1a6459182c593976fdb847fa67bfc40a099b851bc9d3bebd7959c87488c712","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}